==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 4~14 seconds<sup>120f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Hoshi Grandmarnier (Enemy)|Hoshi Grandmarnier]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~13.33 seconds<sup>120f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

